#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:63
msgid "Built-in parsers"
msgstr "内置解析器"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:65
msgid ""
"sbt comes with several built-in parsers defined in "
"`sbt.complete.DefaultParsers`. <!-- ../api/sbt/internal/util/complete/"
"DefaultParsers$.html -->"
msgstr ""
"sbt 在 `sbt.complete.DefaultParsers` 中定义了若干内置解析器。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:68
msgid "Some commonly used built-in parsers are:"
msgstr ""
"常用内置解析器包括："

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:70
msgid ""
"`Space`, `NotSpace`, `OptSpace`, and `OptNotSpace` for parsing spaces or non-"
"spaces, required or not."
msgstr ""
"`Space`、`NotSpace`、`OptSpace` 和 `OptNotSpace` 用于解析空格或非空格，必需或可选。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:72
msgid "`StringBasic` for parsing text that may be quoted."
msgstr ""
"`StringBasic` 用于解析可能带引号的文本。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:73
msgid "`IntBasic` for parsing a signed Int value."
msgstr ""
"`IntBasic` 用于解析有符号 Int 值。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:74
msgid ""
"`Digit` and `HexDigit` for parsing a single decimal or hexadecimal digit."
msgstr ""
"`Digit` 和 `HexDigit` 用于解析单个十进制或十六进制数字。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:76
msgid "`Bool` for parsing a `Boolean` value"
msgstr ""
"`Bool` 用于解析 `Boolean` 值"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:78
msgid ""
"See the [DefaultParsers API](../api/sbt/internal/util/complete/"
"DefaultParsers$.html) for details."
msgstr ""
"详情请参阅 [DefaultParsers API](../api/sbt/internal/util/complete/DefaultParsers$.html)。"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:82
msgid "Combining parsers"
msgstr "组合解析器"

#: src/reference/reference/tab-completion-parser.md:84
msgid ""
"We build on these basic parsers to construct more interesting parsers. We "
"can combine parsers in a sequence, choose between parsers, or repeat a "
"parser."
msgstr ""
"我们在这些基本解析器基础上构建更有用的解析器。可将解析器按序组合、在解析器间选择或重复解析器。"

